                <pb facs="0470" n="382" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg382"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3463: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nicholson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-29T15:00:00-04:00">December 29, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Paraguay has agreed to extension of the armistice for 8 days. Repeated to La Paz,
                    Montevideo, and Buenos Aires.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nicholson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
